  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nSynapse fails to start:\r\n\r\nMar 15 14:36:31 kolab python2.7: 2018-03-15 14:36:31,344 - twisted - 131 - INFO - - Main loop terminated.\r\nMar 15 14:38:53 kolab python2.7: Missing Requirement: Unexpected version of 'pynacl==0.3.0' in '/home/synapse/pyenv/lib/python2.7/site-packages/nacl/__init__.pyc'. '1.2.1' != '0.3.0'\r\nMar 15 14:38:53 kolab python2.7: To install run:\r\nMar 15 14:38:53 kolab python2.7: pip install --upgrade --force \"pynacl==0.3.0\"\r\nMar 15 14:45:12 kolab python2.7: Missing Requirement: Unexpected version of 'pynacl>=0.3.0' in '/home/synapse/pyenv/lib/python2.7/site-packages/nacl/__init__.pyc'. '1.2.1' != '0.3.0'\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n.  pyenv/bin/activate\r\ngit clone https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse\r\ncd synapse\r\ngit checkout v0.27.0-rc1\r\npython synapse/python_dependencies.py | xargs -n1 pip install --upgrade\r\npip install .\r\n\r\n### Patch\r\n\r\ndiff --git a/synapse/__init__.py b/synapse/__init__.py\r\nindex ef8853b..d72d88b 100644\r\n--- a/synapse/__init__.py\r\n+++ b/synapse/__init__.py\r\n@@ -16,4 +16,4 @@\r\n \"\"\" This is a reference implementation of a Matrix home server.\r\n \"\"\"\r\n \r\n-__version__ = \"0.26.0\"\r\n+__version__ = \"0.27.0-rc1\"\r\n",
